{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Q76L6aGSyM1795048601.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國人工智能公司Anthropic，招股價以每股83美元定價，較推介價格區間上限78美元高出百分之6.4。</p><p></p><p>Anthropic將發售9.56億股，加上7名聯合創辦人出售2,360萬股，共發售近9.8億股，每股定價83元，相當於集資813億元，高過今年6月掛牌的SpaceX基礎集資額750億美元。以最終定價計，公司的全面攤薄市值約1.5萬億美元。公司將以「ANT」代號掛牌。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T01:43:54.037119+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":187,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T00:35:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T21:37:42.032579+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T01:37:16.341480+00:00","content_hash":"c1b0349d0134a19a9c0bc05cbd07754c3daa960caff68e24ff69137c4cd79f96","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T01:43:54.037119+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}